}  The panels with a list all look like this one, the Status panel:
}  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------
}  |@SDSF STATUS DISPLAY ALL CLASSES                        LINE 1-4 (4)
}  |@COMMAND INPUT ===>                                        SCROLL ===> PAGE
}  |@NP JOBNAME TYPE JNUM  PRTY QUEUE      C  POS HDN DEST     SAFF ASYS STAT
