}  |@   HERC01   TSU   104   15 EXECUTION             LOCAL
}  |    PAYROLL  JOB  1201    9 INPUT      A    1     LOCAL
}  |    MYJOB    JOB  1240    1 PRINT      A          LOCAL
}  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------
}  The first line says what the list holds; on its right the rows shown,
}  or a message. You type commands after COMMAND INPUT. The SCROLL field
}  says how far PF7 and PF8 move. Under the headings, one row per job:
}  the NP column on the left takes the action characters. Executing jobs
}  are white. A list longer than the screen goes on with PF8.
}
}  * END OF PART 2 *
}
